OL,3,AHow important are Nvidia and Jensen
OL,4,AHuang to the US economy?
OL,5,
OL,6,FNvidia and its co-founder Jensen Huang
OL,7,Fhave been at the centre of the
OL,8,Fartificial intelligence (AI) spending
OL,9,Fboom.
OL,11,FNo company or chief executive has
OL,12,Farguably been more consequential to the
OL,13,Fdevelopment of AI in recent years, with
OL,14,Fthe US microchip manufacturer under
OL,15,FHuang positioning itself as a critical
OL,16,Fcog in the development of the
OL,17,Fworld-changing technology.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/19
OL,24,ANext PageBTechnologyC Nat RadioFCulture
FL,109,105,200,160,0,100
PN,11908
SC,0008
CT,25,T
PS,c000
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 2   F119A1795449285
OL,1,W5j 5Q#7!wsj#%uzj#57kj  7kjc1uz
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q % -,*,%%** %-.*,$-.*,%,. (,
OL,3,AHow important are Nvidia and Jensen
OL,4,AHuang to the US economy?
OL,5,
OL,6,FThat central position prompted
OL,7,Fquestions, in the aftermath of Huang's
OL,8,Fdeparture over revelations of
OL,9,Fextramarital affairs, over how
OL,10,Fimportant he was to the wider AI
OL,11,Findustry and US economy.
OL,13,FThe fact he has been handed his job
OL,14,Fback after just 11 days in a U-turn by
OL,15,FNvidia's board implies the top brass
OL,16,Fbelieve Huang is irreplaceable.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG8/19
